      "description": "VHS tape lyric visualizer: real rap/hip-hop performance footage in the background, cover-fit and tape-graded (desaturated, tinted, rgb fringe, scanlines, grain, tracking wobble), with yellow lower-third lyrics, rgb fringing, soft glow and a minimal play/timecode hud.",
